-bottom: 1px solid #EFEADB; vertical-align: middle">1st Sem 2023–2024</td><td  style="text-align: left; padding: 11px 14px; font-size: 13.5px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EFEADB; vertical-align: middle">Midyear 2025</td><td  style="text-align: left; padding: 11px 14px; font-size: 13.5px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EFEADB; vertical-align: middle">Initial assignment</td></tr><tr class="row"><td  style="text-align: left; padding: 11px 14px; font-size: 13.5px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EFEADB; vertical-align: middle">BSCS 2025–present</td><td  style="text-align: left; padding: 11px 14px; font-size: 13.5px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EFEADB; vertical-align: middle">1st Sem 2025–2026</td><td  style="text-align: left; padding: 11px 14px; font-size: 13.5px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EFEADB; vertical-align: middle">—</td><td  style="text-align: left; padding: 11px 14px; font-size: 13.5px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EFEADB; vertical-align: middle">Transfer approved by Dr. Leo Santos, 30 Jul 2025</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section><div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 16px; align-items: stretch"><section  style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E1DBC6; border-radius: 6px; overflow: hidden; min-width: 0"><header style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; padding: 16px 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EFEADB"><div><h3 style="font-size: 15.5px">Endorse a curriculum transfer</h3><p style="font-size: 13px; color: #6E6C58; margin-top: 3px">The Department Head approves the transfer. Nothing changes until then.</p></div></header><div style="padding: 20px"><form id="cur-form" novalidate><div style="display: grid; gap: 18px"><label for="cur-to" style="display: block; width: 100%"><div style="font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #6E6C58; margin-bottom: 6px">Transfer to</div><div style="position: relative"><select class="fld" id="cur-to"  style="appearance: none; -webkit-appearan