gn-items: center; gap: 14px; font-size: 12.5px; color: #8C8A76"><div><strong style="color: #16200C; font-size: 13.5px">Prof. Ramon Reyes</strong> · <span data-date>17 Sept 2026</span></div><div data-note-actions><button type="button" class="btns" data-note-act="archive" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 7px; border-radius: 8px; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; text-decoration: none; padding: 6px 12px; font-size: 13px; background: #FFFFFF; color: #16200C; border: 1px solid #E1DBC6">Archive</button></div></div><p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.65; margin-top: 8px; white-space: pre-wrap">Discussed a manageable course load. Review the CSci 102 (Discrete Structures I) completion requirements before the October deadline.</p></article><article data-note data-state="active" style="padding: 16px 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EFEADB"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 14px; font-size: 12.5px; color: #8C8A76"><div><strong style="color: #16200C; font-size: 13.5px">Prof. Ramon Reyes</strong> · <span data-date>14 Aug 2026</span></div><div data-note-actions><button type="button" class="btns" data-note-act="archive" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 7px; border-radius: 8px; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; text-decoration: none; padding: 6px 12px; font-size: 13px; background: #FFFFFF; color: #16200C; border: 1px solid #E1DBC6">Archive</button></div></div><p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.65; margin-top: 8px; white-space: pre-wrap">Reviewed the CS Elective 1 mapping and explained how it appears in the curriculum checklist.</p></article><article data-note data-state="active" style="padding: 16px 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EFEADB"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 14px; font-size: 12.5px; color: #8C8A76"><div><strong style="color: #16200C; font-size: 13.5px">Prof. Ramon Reyes</strong> · <span data-date>2 Mar 2026</span></div><div data-note-actions><button type="button" class="btns" data-note-act="archive" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 7px; border-radius: 8px; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; text-decoration: none; padding: 6px 12px; font-size: 13px; background: #FFFFFF; color: #16200C; border: 1px solid #E1DBC6">Archive</button></div></div><p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.65; margin-top: 8px; white-space: pre-wrap">Accepted Envi 11 as equivalent for the discontinued ScTS 11a. Student informed in person.</p></article><article data-note data-state="archived" hidden style="padding: 16px 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EFEADB"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 14px; font-size: 12.5px; color: #8C8A76"><div><strong style="color: #16200C; font-size: 13.5px">Prof. Lourdes Mendez</strong> · <span data-date>12 Jun 2024</span></div><div data-note-actions><button type="button" class="btns" data-note-act="restore" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 7px; border-radius: 8px; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; text-decoration: none; padding: 6px 12px; font-size: 13px; background: #FFFFFF; color: #16200C; border: 1px solid #E1DBC6">Restore</button></div></div><p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.65; margin-top: 8px; white-space: pre-wrap">Handover to Prof. Reyes. Student is on track and prefers morning consultations.</p></article><article data-note data-state="archived" hidden style="padding: 16px 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EFEADB"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 14px; font-size: 12.5px; color: #8C8A76"><div><strong style="color: #16200C; font-size: 13.5px">Prof. Lourdes Mendez</strong> · <span data-date>20 Nov 2023</span></div><div data-note-actions><button type="button" class="btns" data-note-act="restore" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 7px; border-radius: 8px; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; text-decoration: none; padding: 6px 12px; font-size: 13px; background: #FFFFFF; color: #16200C; border: 1px solid #E1DBC6">Restore</button></div></div><p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.65; margin-top: 8px; white-space: pre-wrap">Reviewed prior web application coursework for transfer credit toward CSci 135.</p></article><p data-notes-empty hidden style="padding: 28px 20px; text-align: center; font-size: 14px; color: #6E6C58"></p></div></div></section><dialog id="dlg-note" aria-labelledby="dlg-note-title" style="width: min(600px, calc(100vw - 32px)); padding: 0; border: 1px solid #E1DBC6; border-radius: 6px; background: #FFFFFF; color: #16200C; box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(22,32,12,0.28)"><header style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; padding: 18px 20px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EFEADB"><div><h2 id="dlg-note-title" class="dsp" style="font-size: 22px">Write a note</h2><p data-dlg-sub style="font-size: 13px; color: #6E6C58; margin-top: 5px">Staff-only. Write what the next adviser should know.</p></div><button type="button" data-close aria-label="Close" class="btns" style="width: 34px; height: 34px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid transparent; background: transparent; color: #6E6C58; cursor: pointer; flex-shrink: 0"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex-shrink: 0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18"/></svg></button></header><div style="padding: 20px"><label for="nt-body" style="display: block; width: 100%"><div style="font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #6E6C58; margin-bottom: 6px">Note</div><textarea class="fld" id="nt-body" rows="4" placeholder="What was discussed or decided?" style="resize: vertical; min-height: 96px"></textarea></label><div id="nt-msg" style="margin-top: 12px" hidden></div></div><footer style="display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; gap: 10px; padding: 14px 20px; background: #FBF8EF; border-top: 1px solid #EFEADB"><button type="button" class="btns" data-close style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 7px; border-radius: 8px; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; text-decoration: none; padding: 9px 16px; font-size: 14px; background: transparent; color: #2F4A12; border: 1px solid transparent">Cancel</button><button type="button" class="btnp" data-save=note style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 7px; border-radius: 8px; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; text-decoration: none; padding: 9px 16px; font-size: 14px; background: #2F4A12; color: #FBF8EF; border: 1px solid #2F4A12">Save note</button></footer></dialog><p style="font-size: 12px; color: #8C8A76; margin-top: 22px">Sample records for presentation · Reference date: 19 September 2026</p></main></div></div>
