 and title carry over automatically. Other courses carry over through the Department Head's equivalencies; the rest are listed as not credited.</p></form></div></section><section  style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E1DBC6; border-radius: 6px; overflow: hidden; min-width: 0"><header style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; padding: 16px 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EFEADB"><div><h3 style="font-size: 15.5px">Curriculum shift preview</h3><p style="font-size: 13px; color: #6E6C58; margin-top: 3px">Explore another curriculum without changing the record.</p></div></header><div style="padding: 20px"><label for="shift-cv" style="display: block; width: 100%"><div style="font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #6E6C58; margin-bottom: 6px">Target curriculum</div><div style="position: relative"><select class="fld" id="shift-cv" data-shift='{"cv1": ["50", "6", "1.57"], "cv2": ["6", "50", "1.63"]}' style="appearance: none; -webkit-appearance: none; padding-right: 34px; cursor: pointer"><option value="cv1">BSCS · 2023–2024</option><option value="cv2" selected>BSIT · 2024–2025</option></select><span style="position: absolute; right: 11px; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); pointer-events: none; display: flex"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="#8C8A76" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex-shrink: 0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></span></div></label><div style="height: 18px"></div><div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 24px"><div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E1DBC6; border-radius: 6px; padding: 18px 20px 20px; min-width: 0"><div class="kick" style="color: #8C8A76">Carried units</div><div class="dsp" id="shift-c" style="font-size: 38px; margin-top: 10px; color: #2F4A12">6</div><div style="font-size: 12.5px; color: #8C8A76; margin-top: 6px">